remarks.para:
The class is designed for easy manipulation of SQL SELECT statements. It allows you to perform the following tasks:
Construct SELECT statements in run time;
Modify the statements with object-oriented interface;
Parse the statements from strings. The class exposes SELECT, ORDER BY and GROUP BY clauses as collections of objects (), and FROM clause as collection of objects (). The WHERE and HAVING clauses are represented as string expressions.

